<title>SPAIN: Gas Natural confirms share split effective July 21.</title>
<headline>Gas Natural confirms share split effective July 21.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gas Natural's four-for-one share split will be effective on July 21, a spokesman for the Spanish energy firm confirmed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shares' face value will fall to 150 pesetas from 600 pesetas, and then rise to 500 pesetas via a free capital increase of 52 billion pesetas, charged to reserves.</p>
<p>The total number of shares will rise to 149 million shares from 37.3 million, while reserves will fall to 250 billion pesetas from 302 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
